  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.9.9\n\t\t\t- Add support for .NET 9\n\t\t\t- Add brush properties to TabControl\n\t\t\t- Added properties, events, fixes to FlatButton, MenuButton\n\t\t\t- Various fixes and improvements across the board\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tVersion 1.9.8\n\t\t\t- New SplitButton, FlatRepeatButton controls\n            - Rewrote how FontSelectDialog handles font weights\n            - New IClickSelectableControl interface to use with SelectPanel\n            \n            Version 1.9.7\n\t\t\t- Add TransformEditDialog, TransformEditor for PropertyList\n\t\t\t- Add support for .NET 8, and .NET Framework 4.0, 4.5, and 4.6.1\n\t\t\t- Improvements to SelectPanel, various PropertyList editors\n\t\t\t- Various other smaller improvements and bug fixes\n            \n\t\t\tSee website for more details!",
